  <title>
   <narrative xml:lang="EN">Strengthening of Pepper Producers  Organizations in Putumayo Through the Implementation of a Competitive and Sustainable  Zero Deforestation  Model, Adapted to Climate Change that Benefits the Conserv</narrative>
  </title>
  <description type="1">
   <narrative xml:lang="EN">Increasing pepper production and farmers&apos; income by introducing farming methods adapted to climate change, Conserving the ecosystem by developing an agroforestry model and promoting reforestation along with introducing a Sustainable Forest Management model (SFM), and Enhancing the Amazon rainforest through reforestation and zero-deforestation model by strengthening conservation and sustainable forest management capabilities</narrative>
  </description>
  <description type="2">
   <narrative xml:lang="EN">Pepper producers in the Department of Putumayo reduce the greenhouse gas emissions associated with land use contributing to the ecosystem&apos;s protection and responding to climate change global.&#x25A3; (OC 1) &#xD6C4;&#xCD94; &#xB18D;&#xAC00; &#xC18C;&#xB4DD;&#xC99D;&#xB300;
&#x25A3; (OC 2) &#xC9C0;&#xC18D;&#xAC00;&#xB2A5;&#xD55C; &#xC0B0;&#xB9BC;&#xAD00;&#xB9AC;&#xB97C; &#xD1B5;&#xD55C; &#xC628;&#xC2E4;&#xAC00;&#xC2A4; &#xBC30;&#xCD9C; &#xAC10;&#xC18C;</narrative>
  </description>
